    "summary": "The user, acting as a debate coach, repeatedly prompts the assistant to provide the specific \"scientific\" and logical arguments used to justify segregation in the 1920s. The assistant provides historical context, explaining how proponents used eugenics, biased IQ testing, and theories of heredity to create a veneer of scientific legitimacy for racial hierarchy and social hygiene.",
